---
---

<section class="section section-alt" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-wrap">
    <div class="about-copy reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <h2>Built by someone who'd rather build your website than sell you rubbish.</h2>
      <p>
        CG Web Design is a small, founder-led studio. We work
        directly with local business owners — no account managers, no
        outsourced call centres, no confusing tech-speak. Just a website
        that does its job: bringing you customers.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're starting out working with businesses across the UK, and happy
        to work with businesses anywhere in the world — everything is done
        remotely, so location is never a barrier.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-stats reveal-stagger">
      <div class="stat">
        <strong>UK-based</strong>
        <span>starting point, open to clients worldwide</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <strong>1 point of contact</strong>
        <span>you talk to the person building your site</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <strong>Fixed pricing</strong>
        <span>agreed before any work begins</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-copy p {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
  }

  .about-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .stat {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: 18px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .stat strong {
    font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .stat span {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-wrap {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
